  "content": {
    "id": "p20-q9-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "9",
    "prompt": "Using the common logarithm, determine which of $55^{55}$ or $44^{66}$ is greater.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$44^{66}>55^{55}$.\n\nCompare their common logarithms using the power law.",
      "worked": "Using the table, $\\log_{10}5.50\\approx0.7404$ and $\\log_{10}4.40\\approx0.6435$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\log_{10}(55^{55})&=55\\log_{10}55\\\\\\log_{10}(55^{55})&=55(1+\\log_{10}5.50)\\\\\\log_{10}(55^{55})&\\approx55(1.7404)\\\\\\log_{10}(55^{55})&\\approx95.722\\end{align*}$$\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\log_{10}(44^{66})&=66\\log_{10}44\\\\\\log_{10}(44^{66})&=66(1+\\log_{10}4.40)\\\\\\log_{10}(44^{66})&\\approx66(1.6435)\\\\\\log_{10}(44^{66})&\\approx108.471\\end{align*}$$\n\nSince $108.471>95.722$ and the common logarithm is increasing, $44^{66}>55^{55}$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 55
  },
